{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"t":"Once you get started, you should be prepared for things to go wrong. Every business faces","y":0.10220547915763945,"w":0.63509689331054697,"h":0.019475164073092577,"c":1,"x":0.19542718924450603},{"x":0.1972318216706816,"c":1,"h":0.01308139510051276,"y":0.12063953500540558,"t":"problems and here are a few examples from street food businesses that I know.","w":0.55017303466796874},{"t":"My friends who run Thai Basil started by juggling their street food business with their day jobs","x":0.19541945963876609,"h":0.019621880426533678,"c":1,"w":0.64202631632486984,"y":0.14190251333448611},{"t":"in a restaurant. Their work-life balance was non-existent as they were working til midnight in","y":0.1591987110688623,"w":0.62987828572591154,"x":0.19370779434398183,"h":0.017376238353774665,"c":1},{"y":0.17300534873788087,"c":1,"x":0.19540700899645316,"h":0.017662171803628612,"w":0.56421274820963541,"t":"the restaurant all week and then took their food truck to markets on their days off."},{"t":"The owners of Basque found it was hard to make a profit because the price of fish -","h":0.017422820906108583,"x":0.19370305943741906,"w":0.58145095825195314,"y":0.19851495298567468,"c":1},{"y":0.21438116153033548,"t":"essential for some of their dishes - was so high. And it was hard to charge customers a","h":0.018176825585442091,"x":0.19370077777853092,"w":0.6022229512532552,"c":1},{"h":0.016162302378927462,"c":1,"x":0.19204151831670552,"w":0.61418685913085946,"t":"lot more for those dishes. So they had to stop focussing on fish dishes and include more","y":0.23093072079369481},{"y":0.24607254134245815,"c":1,"h":0.015931070059475361,"w":0.11804617563883463,"t":"vegetarian food.","x":0.19526302809925511},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"t":"The owners of Lou's kitchen were making salads to order from their van and some of their","y":0.27180232534644744,"w":0.62629755655924479,"x":0.19377163685291682},{"c":1,"w":0.59882558186848955,"t":"dishes were quite complicated. At one of their first events they ended up with people","x":0.19368047979365827,"y":0.28584787809415424,"h":0.017981137488587429},{"x":0.19199764976956649,"c":1,"w":0.6177388000488282,"h":0.018036599422852628,"y":0.30221381633739686,"t":"standing in a long queue for more than 15 minutes - and many of them lost patience. So"},{"x":0.19197822068421555,"w":0.46901931762695315,"c":1,"t":"make sure whatever you offer can be served quickly and efficiently.","y":0.31739659818948951,"h":0.018432248798260997},{"w":0.61072662353515628,"y":0.3428971309827975,"h":0.01469559132260323,"t":"The owners of Chip Chop had found a perfect venue near a beach where there weren't","c":1,"x":0.19377163624079666},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"t":"any other street food trucks. But what they hadn't realised was that they'd need a special","x":0.19204152157063797,"y":0.35899230222791711,"w":0.62283737182617194},{"t":"licence - which individual businesses don't need at markets or festivals. It was a complicated","h":0.014534884186538477,"x":0.19204153362986801,"w":0.64186848958333342,"y":0.37499999976434584,"c":1},{"h":0.016504011427797338,"c":1,"t":"process and in the end they gave up.","x":0.191944372973504,"y":0.38961688813880935,"w":0.26149709065755211},{"t":"So I hope that's given you a flavour of ....","y":0.41424418580889466,"c":1,"x":0.19377162202373777,"w":0.28719724019368492,"h":0.014534884186538477},{"c":1,"x":0.19367395713521471,"y":0.47341593727391817,"w":0.086700528462727883,"h":0.015377427749153183,"t":"PART 3"},{"c":1,"h":0.011712429988959827,"y":0.50431820357389789,"x":0.19202766772704119,"w":0.050200719833374013,"t":"MADDY:"},{"h":0.0087209305119230196,"c":1,"x":0.19377162552476576,"y":0.52180232541991056,"w":0.036332181294759125,"t":"RYAN:"},{"y":0.53624792408907618,"x":0.19201236279170841,"t":"MADDY:","h":0.011806477359160406,"w":0.050231329600016278,"c":1},{"y":0.55232558106375673,"w":0.036332178115844715,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"t":"RYAN:","x":0.19204152355020909},{"h":0.011701738692564523,"w":0.050197226206461582,"t":"MADDY:","c":1,"x":0.19202941449188013,"y":0.58426540970207941},{"y":0.63226744169898041,"w":0.036332181294759125,"t":"RYAN:","h":0.0087209305119230196,"c":1,"x":0.19204152172718791},{"c":1,"t":"MADDY:","y":0.6626687307638286,"w":0.050262521107991537,"x":0.19026666360144651,"h":0.013325328840251727},{"t":"RYAN:","x":0.19204152172286265,"y":0.71220930216513478,"w":0.036332181294759125,"h":0.0087209305119230196,"c":1},{"t":"MADDY:","c":1,"h":0.013638015223850775,"x":0.19021041418290807,"w":0.050375019709269192,"y":0.72646587601736046},{"x":0.19031141886398936,"y":0.77470930211165279,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"w":0.038062283198038754,"t":"RYAN:"},{"x":0.19031141822233005,"t":"MADDY:","y":0.83866279084955597,"w":0.04844290733337403,"c":1,"h":0.010174418263205087},{"t":"RYAN:","x":0.1885508149720504,"c":1,"h":0.011769338117937234,"w":0.038123283386230472,"y":0.87056881928513274},{"c":1,"y":0.91715116278404596,"h":0.01308139510051276,"w":0.050173009236653632,"x":0.18858131574499501,"t":"MADDY:"},{"t":"Shall we go through our research for our sustainable fashion project?","y":0.50279916023065296,"h":0.016096188523203825,"x":0.27508651267496192,"w":0.47923873901367181,"c":1},{"x":0.27840954924098127,"c":1,"w":0.34456609090169277,"y":0.51782064719309107,"h":0.016593451930393854,"t":"Good idea. I think l've done enough reading now."},{"t":"Me too. I've learnt such a lot about what sustainability actually means.","h":0.020630811794059456,"y":0.53217897465520903,"c":1,"x":0.27667646707171362,"w":0.48471781412760412},{"c":1,"y":0.55073477934608017,"w":0.55190312703450517,"x":0.27508649867219676,"h":0.016125685689831415,"t":"Mmm, same for me with ethical fashion. I didn't really appreciate the difference"},{"w":0.45186258951822922,"c":1,"h":0.019439715952035752,"x":0.27494352931053545,"y":0.56434757260425605,"t":"between that and sustainable fashion before doing this research."},{"t":"Iknow - most people use these terms interchangeably - but in fact the","w":0.49480967203776044,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820434,"y":0.58284883728380521,"x":0.27335640956063739},{"x":0.27502017351869068,"y":0.59728857128538149,"h":0.017708295204157287,"c":1,"w":0.53299667358398439,"t":"difference is quite distinct when you think about it. Sustainable relates to the"},{"t":"environment and ethical relates more to the way workers or animals are treated.","x":0.27681660820889914,"y":0.61476557010946598,"h":0.013296011196640922,"w":0.5536332194010416,"c":1},{"w":0.55536331176757825,"h":0.01614195955141684,"c":1,"y":0.63081395356225523,"t":"I totally understand why people get confused, though. There are so many other","x":0.27335640627159835},{"t":"terms used - like 'eco-friendly', which is actually quite meaningless.","c":1,"x":0.27335640531832894,"y":0.64520643829768787,"w":0.47058822631835939,"h":0.017584258814305254},{"h":0.018000100191195134,"c":1,"x":0.27502771287084482,"w":0.55893386840820314,"t":"And the way companies use these terms when describing their products doesn't","y":0.66125059456645918},{"t":"help. They're often deliberately vague, I think, and don't provide enough","w":0.5103806050618489,"h":0.01611246238478925,"x":0.27508651399067807,"y":0.67877906984230552,"c":1},{"w":0.33929224650065098,"c":1,"t":"information about how their products are made.","h":0.016765164027604418,"x":0.27326351265815779,"y":0.69320541046464546},{"w":0.034525581995646148,"h":0.016480322398031544,"c":1,"x":0.2735144247849538,"t":"Yes.","y":0.70825134139691559},{"x":0.27335639117153943,"w":0.5432526143391927,"y":0.72529069770499521,"h":0.016136874178225069,"c":1,"t":"It was interesting to read about the debates surrounding wool production and"},{"h":0.017315610961700534,"c":1,"t":"how ethical and sustainable that is. It's generally considered to be sustainable","x":0.27329659831618852,"y":0.74088872561818608,"w":0.53990931193033842},{"h":0.018519013807271389,"x":0.27484675185329022,"c":1,"y":0.75439739141939355,"t":"because it's a natural product.","w":0.20991091410319013},{"x":0.27508650113910371,"y":0.77325581402579568,"h":0.016107377011597479,"c":1,"t":"And it also lasts a long time and can be recycled. All very positive. But I wasn't","w":0.54498270670572924},{"y":0.78924418580484479,"t":"convinced by the argument that wool production is sustainable because it","w":0.51557093302408852,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"x":0.27335640176586956},{"x":0.27335639678764834,"y":0.80510846776624878,"c":1,"h":0.016112462384789139,"w":0.52941177368164061,"t":"doesn't use many chemicals - what about all the fungicides and insecticides"},{"t":"used in sheep farming?","c":1,"x":0.27335640428282793,"w":0.16435985565185546,"y":0.82120363905433102,"h":0.01469559132260323},{"x":0.27502667808307879,"t":"Good point. And I couldn't find any evidence for the claim about sheep farming","h":0.017507661882190995,"c":1,"y":0.83573050960484319,"w":0.55548288981119787},{"c":1,"x":0.2732647356288182,"t":"being better for the environment than cattle farming.","y":0.85176754498101359,"w":0.37215504964192708,"h":0.01748841154233316},{"t":"No - they're both really bad. I read different reports about how unethical it is to","c":1,"y":0.86913925817294435,"x":0.2733564005654826,"w":0.55363321940104171,"h":0.014695591322603119},{"t":"even shear sheep. Some people say it's cruel but as long as the sheep are kept","c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.88517441836919464,"x":0.27508650695491343,"w":0.54671279907226566},{"t":"in good condition I can't see anything wrong with it.","y":0.89943049404001074,"w":0.36178426106770833,"h":0.018252932666647737,"x":0.27325420612870743,"c":1},{"t":"Me neither.","x":0.27328453671900443,"w":0.083188711802164694,"c":1,"y":0.91682171413392077,"h":0.013740292623211525},{"t":"Test 3","c":1,"h":0.014743748205036766,"x":0.86501065972656233,"y":0.058035102281678519,"w":0.051985600789387965},{"x":0.85640138459052384,"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"Q17","h":0.013081395100512871,"y":0.16279069776010613,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.032871971130371103,"x":0.85640138459052384,"y":0.20203488380661772,"t":"Q18","h":0.013081395100512871},{"c":1,"t":"Q19","x":0.85640138363904939,"y":0.27325581403677124,"w":0.03114186922709139,"h":0.01308139510051276},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"y":0.36191860473685022,"t":"Q20","h":0.01308139510051276,"x":0.85467128078429555,"c":1},{"w":0.055540587107340555,"c":1,"x":0.85285254399137744,"t":"021\/22","y":0.58403291758734277,"h":0.013620211078705147},{"h":0.013364395451262001,"c":1,"x":0.85289419386622223,"t":"Q21\/22","y":0.68009105806696313,"w":0.055457286834716846},{"x":0.85107474033917241,"t":"Q23\/24","w":0.055635986328125053,"y":0.77574387683761359,"h":0.013919223013918569,"c":1},{"h":0.013181544918543509,"y":0.8386127158904183,"t":"Q23\/24","c":1,"x":0.85292444441862014,"w":0.055396785736083975},{"y":0.95784883727400372,"h":0.013081395100512871,"x":0.87716263031244879,"c":1,"t":"109","w":0.032871971130371103}]}